# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CONFIDENTIALITY GUARD: contracts, trade records, exports and credentials must
# never be committed. Source evidence lives on the L drive / UNC share only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Contract / email / document evidence and spreadsheets (all locations).
# Character classes make these case-insensitive (git is case-sensitive on Linux), and
# the second pattern catches renamed copies such as contract.pdf.txt (Codex review).
*.[pP][dD][fF]
*.[pP][dD][fF].*
*.[mM][sS][gG]
*.[mM][sS][gG].*
*.[eE][mM][lL]
*.[eE][mM][lL].*
*.[tT][iI][fF]
*.[tT][iI][fF].*
*.[tT][iI][fF][fF]
*.[tT][iI][fF][fF].*
*.[dD][oO][cC][xX]
*.[dD][oO][cC][xX].*
*.[dD][oO][cC]
*.[dD][oO][cC].*
*.[zZ][iI][pP]
*.[zZ][iI][pP].*
*.[xX][lL][sS][xX]
*.[xX][lL][sS][xX].*
*.[xX][lL][sS][mM]
*.[xX][lL][sS][mM].*
*.[xX][lL][sS]
*.[xX][lL][sS].*
*.[cC][sS][vV]
*.[cC][sS][vV].*
*.[rR][tT][fF]
*.[rR][tT][fF].*
*.7[zZ]
*.7[zZ].*
*.[rR][aA][rR]
*.[rR][aA][rR].*

# ...except the exact blank templates produced by `riskparse inventory-template --csv`.
# Anything else in inventory/templates/ (e.g. a completed copy) stays ignored.
!inventory/templates/October_2026_Source_Inventory_TEMPLATE.xlsx
!inventory/templates/inventory_Source_Coverage.csv
!inventory/templates/inventory_Contract_Documents.csv
